# Mimir V2 Compatibility Adapter

## Purpose

Preserve the former Digital Cell Mimir V2 lifecycle reference while routing active Mimir applicability and failure handling through the canonical `.cursor/skills/mimir/SKILL.md` and Authority policy.

## Activation

Activate only when the project profile has a verified Mimir binding and the configured Mimir service exposes the required lifecycle operations.

## Non-applicability

Do not claim Mimir context, validation, evidence, retrieval feedback, or closure when the configured service or tools are unavailable.

## Fallback

If Mimir is unavailable, record the exact blocked step in `.agent/CURRENT.md` and `.agent/OUTCOMES.md`, continue only when safe, and report it as blocked or unrun.

## Control status

This is an advisory compatibility adapter; the canonical Authority governance skill and Mimir skill define active policy.
